{"synopsis":"Kehidupan SMA Eunha berubah drastis ketika para pengganggu memaksanya melakukan ritual pemanggilan hantu yang membawa Haesu, roh yang menawan namun menyeramkan, ke dalam hidupnya. Mengaku sebagai temannya, Haesu mulai membalas dendam kepada para pengganggu Eunha. Namun, metode kekerasan yang digunakan Haesu membuat Eunha khawatir, dan dia mulai mencari jawaban untuk mengungkap masa lalu dan identitas asli Haesu.","alternative_title":"클래스메이트","author":"Sooriboo","artist":"Sooriboo","chapters":[{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"ch_53","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"e794c6a4-dd85-4c6e-bfa7-6a71ebe4cffd","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_51553cec-af3a-4238-a802-5c0dda995d68/chapter_ch_52/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"b92e559e-6e6e-47ea-a5eb-89f68bec65d8","num